VALUES ('cf9cf42e-bd2b-5502-bda8-b57ee3dd317d', '2f9effac-123b-5849-93ad-e8ad75fa70fb', 'text', 'Vocabulary', '{"text": "## Around the Office\n\n**Desk** — The table where you sit and do work.\n_My computer is on the desk._\n\n**Chair** — The object you sit on at work.\n_This office chair is comfortable._\n\n**Computer** — The machine you use to work and check email.\n_I turn on my computer._\n\n**Phone** — The device used to speak to clients.\n_The office phone is ringing._\n\n**Paper** — Material used for writing documents or printing.\n_I need white paper._\n\n**Pen** — An object used to write with ink.\n_Where is my blue pen?_\n\n**Table** — A large piece of furniture for meetings.\n_The documents are on the table._\n\n**Room** — A specific area inside the office building.\n_This is the meeting room._\n\n**Door** — The entrance into an office space.\n_Please close the office door._\n\n**Window** — The glass in the wall to see outside.\n_My desk is near the window._\n"}', 0, NOW(), NOW())
ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
