VALUES ('84754333-6fc4-5bbf-a906-863f33b1ea72', 'cd6b5bc1-ef0d-5198-88c3-4438c007bd36', 'text', 'Vocabulary', '{"text": "## Opening a File\n\n**File** — A digital document stored on a computer.\n_Click to open the budget file._\n\n**Open** — To launch a program or look inside a document.\n_Please open the report file._\n\n**Click** — To press a button on a computer mouse.\n_Double-click on the blue icon._\n\n**Folder** — A digital place where you organize multiple files.\n_The invoices are in this folder._\n\n**Find** — To look for and discover a document.\n_I cannot find the client profile._\n\n**Laptop** — A small computer you can carry easily.\n_Open your laptop and start work._\n\n**Icon** — A small picture on a screen that opens an app.\n_Click the green icon on your screen._\n\n**Screen** — The part of a monitor or laptop that shows images.\n_Look at the screen for a second._\n\n**See** — To look at something with your eyes.\n_Can you see the document now?_\n\n**Mouse** — The hand-controlled object used to move the cursor.\n_Move the mouse to the left corner._\n"}', 0, NOW(), NOW())
ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
