VALUES ('b4ba29ef-51b3-57cb-b765-10a9eb882b42', 'd613ee6b-cb7b-5d7e-8ff6-7d18789e312c', 'text', 'Vocabulary', '{"text": "## Asking the Interviewer Questions\n\n**Ask** — To put a question to the hiring manager.\n_Can I ask a question about the team?_\n\n**What** — Asking for specific information about duties.\n_What is a typical workday like here?_\n\n**Who** — Asking about the identity of your supervisor.\n_Who is the direct manager for this role?_\n\n**When** — Asking about the time or schedule.\n_When does the training program start?_\n\n**Train / Training** — Learning the specific rules and tasks of the company.\n_Do you offer staff training?_\n\n**Hours** — The official times spent at work daily.\n_What are the standard working hours?_\n\n**Salary** — The money you receive every month for your job.\n_We can discuss the salary structure later._\n\n**Office** — The physical environment where you sit.\n_Is the office located near the station?_\n\n**Next** — The following step in the selection process.\n_What are the next steps in this application?_\n\n**More** — Additional details about the position.\n_I want to know more about the job duties._\n"}', 0, NOW(), NOW())
ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
